WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.350
Leave an old bike out in
the rain, and slowly,

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.510
rust creeps across it.

3
00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:07.190
Now picture a bonfire.

4
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:12.310
It roars with heat and light, and
soon it has burned right down.

5
00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.950
One change is slow and quiet.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.790
The other is fast and fierce.

7
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:21.110
Could these two changes have
anything in common at all?

8
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.530
In this mission, you'll meet
four types of reaction:

9
00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:29.230
combustion, thermal decomposition,
oxidation and displacement.

10
00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:32.950
Then you'll learn to spot
each one from its equation.

11
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.850
Your mission: find out what a
rusting bike and a bonfire have

12
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:37.940
in common.
